(Harbor Light Squadron 3 Meeting Minutes)
(July 14, 2026)
(Called to Order: The regular meeting was called to order by Commander Jordan Hale.)
(Roll Call: Jordan Hale conducted roll call.)
(Approval of Previous Minutes: Approved as printed.)
(Reports:)
(Finance Officer [Riley Chen]: Presented the quarterly report.)
(Old Business:)
(Picnic planning tabled.)
(Membership drive: follow up at the next meeting.)
(New Business:)
(1. Motion by Jordan Hale, seconded by Riley Chen, to accept the quarterly report as presented. Motion carried.)
(2. Motion by Alex Morgan, seconded by Casey Quinn, to table the picnic until the next meeting. Motion tabled.)
(Adjournment: The meeting was adjourned.)
(Submitted by Morgan Ellis, Adjutant, Harbor Light Squadron 3.)
(In service to the community)
